#: ../../getting_started/functionality/agent/installMethods.rst:79
msgid ""
"Agent Install scripts can be downloaded from |morpheus| by selecting "
":menuselection:`Actions --> Download Agent Script` from a Server detail "
"page, then run manually on the target host when required for a given "
"managed resource. Please note the script will be unique per managed "
"resource and should not be saved to run as needed on any arbitrary "
"resources in the future."
msgstr ""
"Agent Install scripts puede ser downloaded desde |morpheus| by selecting "
":menuselection:`Actions --> Download Agent Script` desde a Server detail "
"page, then run manually on the target host when obligatorio for a given "
"gestionado resource. Please note the script será unique per gestionado "
"resource y should not be saved ejecutar as needed on any arbitrary "
"resources in the future."

#: ../../getting_started/functionality/agent/installMethods.rst:81
msgid ""
"When installing on Windows, continue with the steps below to complete "
"manual installation:"
msgstr ""
"When installing on Windows, continue con la steps a continuación to "
"complete manual installation:"

#: ../../getting_started/functionality/agent/installMethods.rst:83
msgid "Open powershell as an administrator"
msgstr "Open powershell as an administrator"

#: ../../getting_started/functionality/agent/installMethods.rst:84
msgid ""
"Run the ``unblock-file cmdlet`` against the download agent installation "
"script:"
msgstr ""
"Run the ``unblock-file cmdlet`` contra the download agent installation "
"script:"

#: ../../getting_started/functionality/agent/installMethods.rst:86
msgid ""
"Unblock-File -Path "
"C:\\Users\\User01\\Documents\\Downloads\\agentInstall.ps1\n"
"Get-ExecutionPolicy\n"
"Set-ExecutionPolicy -ExecutionPolicy Unrestricted -Scope CurrentUser"
msgstr ""
"Unblock-File -Path "
"C:\\\\Users\\\\User01\\\\Documents\\\\Downloads\\\\agentInstall.ps1"
"\\nGet-ExecutionPolicy\\nSet-ExecutionPolicy -ExecutionPolicy "
"Unrestricted -Scope CurrentUser"

#: ../../getting_started/functionality/agent/installMethods.rst:92
msgid ""
"After running the powershell script, ensure the script downloaded the msi"
" and the Agent service started correctly:"
msgstr ""
"After running the powershell script, ensure the script downloaded the msi"
" y the Agent service started correctly:"

#: ../../getting_started/functionality/agent/installMethods.rst:94
msgid "Set-ExecutionPolicy -ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned -Scope CurrentUser"
msgstr "Set-ExecutionPolicy -ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned -Scope CurrentUser"

